direction_38 = location "Bulture" about "Bulture\nGiant bulcan-type monster with strong sharp horns used as weapon ingredient " found "Moradon seashore" at 457 350 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "For the protection of Moradon... What did you want to say to me?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Do you know of monsters called Bultures? They belong to the Bulcan species, but 3 times as large. Even the most accomplished warriors are rendered helpless in front of them, but they should be no match for you. Their numbers have increased markedly lately. Nothing trumps Bultures in the Moradon monster food chain so we can't just sit by the sidelines. Can you please hunt them and rein them in?"

On in_progress
    Say "I commend you for accepting my request but you should have kept your word."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_38

On ready
    Say "Wow, you're incredible, Master, getting rid of so many of these giant monsters. Let's hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick and brag."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You succeeded again? Amazing!"
